# ln-sign-positive-strict-full-author
claim:
    ? forall x R+:
        1<x
        =>:
            0<ln(x)
    ln(1)=0
    ln(1)<ln(x)
    0<ln(x)

forall x R+:
    1<x
    =>:
        0<ln(x)

